      "duration_ms": 13000,
      "caption": "Slow path: first waiter uses the pending bit, later ones queue; only the queue head spins on the lock word.",
      "narration": "In the slow path the first waiter just sets the pending bit. Later ones queue as MCS nodes, and only the queue head spins on the lock word. Merged in Linux 4.2.",
